      "html": "<p>A weekly selection of useful agent skills, updates, and practical workflows, delivered every Wednesday.</p><h2><strong>Skill of the Week</strong></h2><p><strong><a href=\"https://github.com/coreyhaines31/marketingskills/blob/1f837447b20bb6f0e72d87b80ece1c221c362c7d/skills/free-tools/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Free Tools</a></strong> &#8212; Will that free calculator bring in potential customers or just give your team another tool to maintain? This skill uses an eight-factor scorecard to evaluate ideas before you build, weighing search demand, buyer fit, and upkeep.</p><h2><strong>Agents &amp; Automation</strong></h2><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/github/awesome-copilot/blob/a06ba06d11f41b996f8c246e2a452e1bf3a17950/skills/on-device-delegate/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Offload read-heavy sub-tasks to local on-device model</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/skills/blob/49f948faa9258a0c61caceaf225e179651397431/skills/.curated/migrate-to-codex/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Migrate Claude instruction, skill, agent, and MCP files to Codex</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/obra/superpowers/blob/22f0b463e7a5e579904dd6211a520321035526f7/skills/executing-plans/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Execute a written implementation plan inline with a ledger</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/juliusbrussee/caveman/blob/9b243662ff98d392bc0a95b865a554583d71be75/skills/caveman-discover/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Label repository LLM workflows for per-workflow spend grouping</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/trailofbits/skills/blob/149d7b21f4067765b82e67029730b42d228ef4b4/plugins/code-improver/skills/skill-improver/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Autonomous review-and-fix loop to improve a Claude Code skill</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/obra/superpowers/blob/22f0b463e7a5e579904dd6211a520321035526f7/skills/verification-before-completion/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Require fresh verification evidence before claiming work complete</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/juliusbrussee/caveman/blob/9b243662ff98d392bc0a95b865a554583d71be75/plugins/caveman/skills/cavecrew/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Choose cavecrew subagents to compress delegation and save context</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/trailofbits/skills/blob/149d7b21f4067765b82e67029730b42d228ef4b4/plugins/chrome-mcp-troubleshooting/skills/chrome-mcp-troubleshooting/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Fix Claude in Chrome MCP extension connection failures on macOS</a></p></li></ul><h2><strong>Development &amp; Engineering</strong></h2><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/expo/skills/blob/dfdebcc6c4c1bf7a9471cefd6b6f39c7ba6c884d/plugins/expo/skills/expo-brownfield/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Embed React Native and Expo into an existing native app</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/google/skills/blob/79d398ad93c0ebd1e5a4c010df8cd672d1976f23/skills/cloud/cloud-databases-onboarding/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Google Cloud database selection and draft provisioning workflow</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/github/awesome-copilot/blob/a06ba06d11f41b996f8c246e2a452e1bf3a17950/skills/gem-devops-guidelines/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">DevOps review rules for deployment, containers, CI and releases</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/juliusbrussee/caveman/blob/9b243662ff98d392bc0a95b865a554583d71be75/skills/caveman-explore/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Read-only repository explorer returning path line citations</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/skills/blob/49f948faa