igma MCP design nodes into production code</a></p></li></ul><h2><strong>Data &amp; Research</strong></h2><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/google/skills/blob/79d398ad93c0ebd1e5a4c010df8cd672d1976f23/skills/cloud/datalineage-summary/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Data lineage graph summary report for BigQuery and Cloud Storage</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/juliusbrussee/caveman/blob/9b243662ff98d392bc0a95b865a554583d71be75/skills/caveman-evidence-review/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Read-only Caveman Cloud evidence review for cost and traces</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/huggingface/skills/blob/5291c2b9365e06b175dc04817610c778623f4836/skills/huggingface-best/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Find and compare Hugging Face benchmark models by task and device</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/google/skills/blob/79d398ad93c0ebd1e5a4c010df8cd672d1976f23/skills/cloud/bigquery-migration-validator/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Validate BigQuery migrations with BQMS schema, aggregate, data checks</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/skills/blob/49f948faa9258a0c61caceaf225e179651397431/skills/.curated/notion-research-documentation/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Notion multi-source research into cited briefs and reports</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/kepano/obsidian-skills/blob/caf3e98cd22d810db164f26c9a442f0a280daa43/plugins/obsidian/skills/defuddle/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Extract clean Markdown from web pages with Defuddle</a></p></li></ul><h2><strong>Writing &amp; Productivity</strong></h2><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/kepano/obsidian-skills/blob/caf3e98cd22d810db164f26c9a442f0a280daa43/plugins/obsidian/skills/obsidian-markdown/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Write Obsidian Markdown with wikilinks, embeds and callouts</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/skills/blob/e4bb5d960d87126ff3b3a8af1a104b7db67560ba/skills/docx/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Create, edit, and verify Word .docx files</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/skills/blob/49f948faa9258a0c61caceaf225e179651397431/skills/.curated/transcribe/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Audio transcription CLI with diarization and speaker references</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/kepano/obsidian-skills/blob/caf3e98cd22d810db164f26c9a442f0a280daa43/plugins/obsidian/skills/obsidian-cli/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Operate Obsidian vaults and develop plugins via CLI</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/skills/blob/e4bb5d960d87126ff3b3a8af1a104b7db67560ba/skills/doc-coauthoring/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Structured three-stage workflow for co-authoring documents</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/kepano/obsidian-skills/blob/caf3e98cd22d810db164f26c9a442f0a280daa43/plugins/obsidian/skills/json-canvas/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Create and edit JSON Canvas files with validated nodes and edges</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/kepano/obsidian-skills/blob/caf3e98cd22d810db164f26c9a442f0a280daa43/plugins/obsidian/skills/obsidian-headless/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Sync and publish Obsidian vaults from the command line</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/kepano/obsidian-skills/blob/caf3e98cd22d810db164f26c9a442f0a280daa43/plugins/obsidian/skills/knap/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Render Obsidian notes from Knap Markdown templates and data</a></p></li></ul><h2><strong>Design &amp; Creative</strong></h2><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/emilkowalski/skills/blob/64eb3deb9a5fbfa041faf783e0bc3fd635872e9c/s