      "html": "<p>A weekly selection of useful agent skills, updates, and practical workflows, delivered every Wednesday.</p><h2><strong>Skill of the Week</strong></h2><p><strong><a href=\"https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/blob/cda84222aa12716f2ceb92b45629487be81a0601/.agents/skills/changelog-video/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">changelog-video</a></strong> &#8212; Turning weekly release notes into a video means juggling visuals, narration, and captions. This internal HyperFrames workflow builds a branded video project from Markdown with animated UI mockups, using repository assets, companion skills, and an authenticated HeyGen CLI.</p><h2><strong>This Week&#8217;s Picks</strong></h2><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/skills/blob/2c5958ecac7cee2b583967a2c4981d0f4a75c579/skills/xlsx/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[Data] Create and edit spreadsheets with openpyxl, pandas, and formulas</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/supabase/agent-skills/blob/c9be0e931b7930f7d02126d04774d904c381e7d7/skills/supabase-postgres-best-practices/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[Data] Prioritized Postgres rules for schema, queries, and RLS</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/coreyhaines31/marketingskills/blob/9d6d7ce8d18eb155dc2f9762435f097e60cdad7c/skills/attribution/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[Marketing] Diagnose which marketing channels actually drive revenue</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/vercel-labs/agent-browser/blob/f423bb090ccdcadd0de587dd77eed3430d93a306/skill-data/derive-client/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[Agent workflows] Deriving Standalone API Clients From HAR Recordings</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/obra/superpowers/blob/22f0b463e7a5e579904dd6211a520321035526f7/skills/subagent-driven-development/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[Agent workflows] Execute plans task-by-task with fresh subagents and reviews</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/vercel-labs/agent-skills/blob/1a2c79d4e6c4a2283dc2c614b6538cbe1ed5ca62/skills/deploy-to-vercel/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[Agent workflows] Vercel Deployment Decision Tree for AI Agents</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills/blob/26dc8e4755a11fea22ed788256c3db50001b013d/skills/find-skills/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[Agent workflows] Discovering and installing agent skills via the Skills CLI</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/github/awesome-copilot/blob/227949a7542a55d2155c00e7cdb998d9a0fee4f3/skills/dependabot/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[Security] Dependabot configuration for updates, grouping, and monorepos</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/trailofbits/skills/blob/e4dd0bb5b15535f7c5a0834187dffba6ac37e4ff/plugins/cvss-scoring/skills/cvss-scoring/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[Security] Score vulnerabilities with structured CVSS v4.0 vectors</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/google/skills/blob/11275189d0e1528c35ef5b38f99717a2349db22b/skills/cloud/api-gateway-openapi-spec-authoring/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[Development] Write and migrate OpenAPI specs for Google Cloud API Gateway</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/expo/skills/blob/a9e5bd3fa00b4e61f632e43f85da73aee1942582/plugins/expo/skills/eas-update/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[Development] EAS Update OTA setup, publishing, build model, and debug steps</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/github/awesome-copilot/blob/227949a7542a55d2155c00e7cdb998d9a0fee4f3/skills/incident-postmortem/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[Development] Blameless Google SRE post-mortem with fishbone and 5 Whys</a></p></li><li><p><a hre